    "detailed_description": "Choose colours, upgrades and talents for your towers to defend against scores of enemies<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051530/extras/3fe4ea7a5114334e6103d9855239b32c.avif?t=1661278080\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>24 Game Maps to Play on!<br></li><li>Adjustable Difficulty Level!<br></li><li>45 Different Upgrades to Purchase!<br></li><li>4 Unique Towers with 12 Possible Tower Abilities and 18 unique Colors to Choose from!<br></li><li>7 Tiers of Talents to Unlock for a total of 26 Distinct Talents!<br></li><li>Map Editor lets you Create and Play your own Custom Maps!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051530/extras/43bdb5b2e89e92d71502c0b2a94ea853.avif?t=1661278080\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventures</h2><br>Quick Tower Defence Ultimate comes with three extra adventures on top of the base game<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Jungle Expedition - Cross the sea and head toward a Jungle of mystery to find lost treasure<br></li><li> Arctic Adventure - Travel to the icy Arctic to find the precious cargo of a long lost ship<br></li><li> Pyramid Quest - Seek out the Pharaoh's Tomb deep within a lost pyramid</li></ul>Each Adventure includes new maps, upgrades, tiles for the map editor and a talent<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051530/extras/2bcd86e179016d76b3afb3cfb230da07.avif?t=1661278080\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Map Editor</h2><br>Create your own maps with the built-in the map editor. <br>Choose from all the tiles used in the game and plan out the path your enemies will take. <br>Check the workshop to find maps others have made or upload your own maps to share with the community.",
    "about_the_game": "Choose colours, upgrades and talents for your towers to defend against scores of enemies<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051530/extras/3fe4ea7a5114334e6103d9855239b32c.avif?t=1661278080\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>24 Game Maps to Play on!<br></li><li>Adjustable Difficulty Level!<br></li><li>45 Different Upgrades to Purchase!<br></li><li>4 Unique Towers with 12 Possible Tower Abilities and 18 unique Colors to Choose from!<br></li><li>7 Tiers of Talents to Unlock for a total of 26 Distinct Talents!<br></li><li>Map Editor lets you Create and Play your own Custom Maps!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051530/extras/43bdb5b2e89e92d71502c0b2a94ea853.avif?t=1661278080\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventures</h2><br>Quick Tower Defence Ultimate comes with three extra adventures on top of the base game<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Jungle Expedition - Cross the sea and head toward a Jungle of mystery to find lost treasure<br></li><li> Arctic Adventure - Travel to the icy Arctic to find the precious cargo of a long lost ship<br></li><li> Pyramid Quest - Seek out the Pharaoh's Tomb deep within a lost pyramid</li></ul>Each Adventure includes new maps, upgrades, tiles for the map editor and a talent<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051530/extras/2bcd86e179016d76b3afb3cfb230da07.avif?t=1661278080\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Map Editor</h2><br>Create your own maps with the built-in the map editor. <br>Choose from all the tiles used in the game and plan out the path your enemies will take. <br>Check the workshop to find maps others have made or upload your own maps to share with the community.",
